trouble shooting:
    error1: Black screen showing "dev/sda1: clean, 552599/6111232 files, 7119295/24414464 blocks"
    error2: Error message “The system is running in low-graphics mode”
    reason: unproper NVIDIA driver, need to reinstall
    solution:
        sudo apt-get purge nvidia*
        sudo ubuntu-drivers autoinstall

        https://askubuntu.com/questions/882385/dev-sda1-clean-this-message-appears-after-i-startup-my-laptop-then-it-w


